      "subject": "Crosswind field depot",
      "family": "orchard",
      "referencePath": "authoring/library/challenge-chapter-art/originals/crosswind-depot.png",
      "brief": "Keep the farm sheds framing a windy field. Reduce dense leaves, sunflowers and muddy detail; the off-center shed silhouettes and open horizon are worth preserving.",
      "status": "planned; no new artwork produced"
